  "recurring_method": [
    "Narratives are organized by EEO-1 job group and state current incumbency, anticipated openings, good-faith hiring intent, and selected promotion/placement/applicant statistics.",
    "Office/Clerical repeatedly receives a minority-recruitment focus because the sources report high female incumbency but low or zero minority incumbency.",
    "The largest operating workforce is reported under Service Workers during this period, and its narrative repeatedly ties goals to driver hiring/attrition.",
    "The narratives compare annual female/minority placements and applicant bases with prior-year goals and explain whether the goal was met or why net representation changed."
  ],
